{'symbol': 'CMI', 'date': '2023-05-19 12:42:00', 'title': 'ACCELERA MARKS START OF OPERATIONS FOR ELECTROLYZER PRODUCTION IN FRIDLEY, MINNESOTA', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, IND.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #CUMMINS--ACCELERA ™ BY CUMMINS, THE ZERO-EMISSIONS BUSINESS SEGMENT OF CUMMINS INC. (NYSE: CMI), TODAY MARKED THE START OF OPERATIONS FOR ELECTROLYZER PRODUCTION IN FRIDLEY, MINNESOTA – ITS FIRST ELECTROLYZER PRODUCTION SITE IN THE UNITED STATES. U.S. DEPARTMENT OF ENERGY SECRETARY JENNIFER GRANHOLM, MINNESOTA GOVERNOR TIM WALZ, AND OTHER FEDERAL, STATE AND LOCAL U.S. OFFICIALS JOINED THE RIBBON CUTTING CEREMONY AT THE SITE, UNDERSCORING THE MOMENTUM OF THE GREEN HYDROGE.'}